# Integrations and scope

- Follow phase order in `docs/INTEGRATIONS_BUILD_PLAN.md` (Ponytail → ingest fabric → in-repo CRM → Huginn → freehire).
- CRM lives in this repo (`/admin/crm`, Neon `crm_*`). UI may be Twenty-inspired or selectively copied per `docs/vendor/TWENTY_UI_AND_FEATURES.md` and `vendor/twenty/README.md`. No Twenty Cloud, no twenty-server, no iframe.
- External tools (Huginn, freehire) only via `POST /api/admin/integrations/ingest` and headless deploy under `deploy/integrations/`.
- Minimal diffs; no secrets in `wrangler.jsonc` or git — use `scripts/sync-cloudflare-env.mjs`.
- Complete the manual test flow for a phase before claiming it done.
